0.1 18aug2019
* initial implementation
0.3.0  2026-10-22
  Independent continuation by weewx-packages, retaining upstream history and GPLv3.
  Support Python 3, WeeWX 5 and pymodbus 3.11 through 3.x.
  Read LS1024B settings around reserved register 0x9068 (upstream issue #1).
  Preserve fractional readings and retry Modbus transport exceptions.
  Correct current/voltage groups, the consumed-energy map and energy units.
  Keep driver and installer versions consistent; add controller-response tests.
0.3.1  2026-10-23
  Accept a fractional timeout, such as 0.5, in weewx.conf and with --timeout.
  Assign group_energy to consumed_energy_today and generated_energy_today.
